title: >-
  Recurrence Risk of Remedial Actions in Post-Market Device Reports:
  A Derived-Outcome Study on openFDA MAUDE
abstract: >-
  A triage system for manufacturing deviations that surfaces the recurrence
  rate historically associated with a proposed corrective action, at the
  moment the action is being written.
